Addition:
    int: x
    int: y
    return: int
    add:
        return: x + y

Checks:
    return: int
    demo:
        int: y 100
        @: fiveContext (merge(Addition; (int: y 5)))
        @: add5 fiveContext\add
        int: omitted add5(1)
        int: overridden add5(1; y := 25)
        int: zero add5(1; y := 0)
        return: omitted * 10000 + overridden * 100 + zero
